# The gateway image builds from the workspace manifests, the shared TypeScript
# settings and the packages it compiles against; nothing else reaches the builder.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!patches/
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/eslint-config
!packages/print-sizes
!packages/cache-tags
!services/gateway

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
services/gateway/Dockerfile*
